# SEO page rules

- One primary keyword per URL; update `docs/KEYWORD-MAP.md` when adding pages.
- Title ≤60 chars with primary keyword near the start; meta description ≤155.
- Exactly one H1; logical H2/H3; answer-first intro 40–60 words on tools/guides.
- Self-referencing canonical; trailing slash; lowercase hyphenated slugs.
- Include BreadcrumbList + WebApplication (tools) or Article (guides).
- No fake ratings; no thin query-variant duplicates.
- Cite sources; set datePublished/dateModified.
